  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be the solution of the differential equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
